ADDENDA <Act No. 3281, Dec. 18, 1980>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Act shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation.
Article 2 (Clearance of unclear dispositions on investigation materials card)
Unclear dispositions among investigation materials cards drawn up before December 31, 1970 shall be cleared up as having a final disposition to be cleared of suspicion simultaneously with the enforcement of this Act; provided, this shall not apply where the result of dispositions is proved after the enforcement of this Act.
Article 3 (Destruction of sentenced inmate plates as non-administration objects under this Act)
Sentenced inmate plates which are not objects for administration as provided in this Act shall be regarded as destroyed at the time when this Act enters into force.

